            "line": 729,
            "text": "theorem weighted_square_ideal (w : ResetWitness d K) (b eta : ℝ) {y : ℝ} (hy : y ≤ 0) :\n    Real.exp (b * y) * E w (y, eta) ^ 2 / 2 =\n      (d.core.P ^ 2 * shape eta ^ 2 / 2) * Real.exp ((b + 1 / 5) * y)"
